{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Galactic Plague 2000 - DEMO</strong> is a space shooter that fuses classic gameplay with modern roguelite touches. Experience it your way with two graphical modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637750/extras/Capture_5.jpg?t=1745335635\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Retro activation view with filters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For old school lovers, with filters and effects that recreate the arcade aesthetics of the 80's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637750/extras/Capture_7.jpg?t=1745335635\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main features of the DEMO:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story Mode: Take on 2 worlds, each with 14 levels and an epic final boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arcade Mode (Extreme Survival): Demo version only a total of 10 levels. Test your skills in the ultimate challenge and compete to be the best player in the world in the global leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades and achievements system to boost your ship and skills, demo version many weapons are locked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 8 types of enemies and 2 final bosses that will test your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different weapon configurations with 5 weapons and 4 special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A great soundtrack with multiple retro sci-fi style themes, fusing 16-bit sounds with cyberpunk and sci-fi cinematic touches. Dynamic rhythms that will transport you to an epic space adventure worthy of a classic anime.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637750?t=1745335635","background_